BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FestiBull of Lights
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T210000
UID:tribe-27053@secondchancenc.org
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the magic of the holiday season at FestiBull of Ligh
 ts! Durham Bulls Athletic Park transforms into a dazzling winter wonderlan
 d featuring thousands of twinkling lights synchronized to festive music. E
 njoy holiday activities for all ages\, including photos with Santa\, the N
 C by Train Holiday Express\, seasonal crafts\, s’mores\, festive food an
 d drinks\, and more. It’s a perfect outing for family and friends to mak
 e some holiday memories!Proceeds for DOG tickets are donated back to Secon
 d Ch
LOCATION:Durham Bulls Athletic Park\, 409 Blackwell Street\, Durham\, NC
URL:https://secondchancenc.org/event/festibull-of-lights-dec3/
X-SOURCE:Second Chance Pet Adoptions
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
